{"story":{"id":"anomaly-star-lifting-category","title":{"zh":"废弃外星平台","en":"Deserted Star Platform"},"category":"exploration","kind":"anomaly","image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","start":"anomalies:star_lifting_category","chapters":6,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"一个废弃外星平台正围绕一颗恒星漫无目的地漂浮。仔细研究或许可以揭示其作用。","en":"A defective platform of alien design is drifting aimlessly around a star. Perhaps closer study could reveal its purpose."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"anomalies:star_lifting_category","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"distar.1020","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1098"},"children":["n3","n4"]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:STAR_LIFTING","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"distar.1020.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:1769"},"children":["n5"]},"n4":{"doc":"special_projects:STAR_LIFTING_WEAPONS","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"distar.1020.c","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:1794"},"children":["n6"]},"n5":{"doc":"distar.1021","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1037"},"children":[]},"n6":{"doc":"distar.1022","parent":"n4","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1062"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"anomalies:star_lifting_category","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"废弃外星平台","en":"Deserted Star Platform"},"texts":[{"zh":"一个废弃外星平台正围绕一颗恒星漫无目的地漂浮。仔细研究或许可以揭示其作用。","en":"A defective platform of alien design is drifting aimlessly around a star. Perhaps closer study could reveal its purpose."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.1020","kind":"research","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1098","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-star-lifting-category"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt","line":1087}},{"id":"distar.1020","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"热能驱动流出","en":"Thermal Driven Outflow"},"texts":[{"zh":"在对[From.GetName]轨道上的平台进行研究后，我们发现它是一种复杂且有些古怪的外星设计。其防水机械与先进气候控制表明，它是由一种会分泌大量液体的物种制造的，很可能是软体动物。\n\n在故障之前，它曾用微波束加热恒星大气层的一部分，诱发持续的大规模喷发，可以极大地增加太阳风的流出。这些能源随后由轨道空间站收集。\n\n该平台是按某种非常实验性的概念设计的。","en":"Closer inspection of the platform orbiting [From.GetName] has revealed that it is of a complex, somewhat erratic, alien design. The waterproofed machinery and advanced climate control suggest it was built for a lifeform that secreted a rich amount of fluids, very likely of the molluscoid variety.\n\nBefore falling into disrepair, microwave beams were used to heat regions of the star's atmosphere, provoking large sustained eruptions that increased the solar wind outflow significantly. The energy was then harvested with an orbital mine.\n\nThe platform is designed around some highly experimental concepts."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.1020.a","label":{"zh":"修复平台。","en":"Repair the platform."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:STAR_LIFTING","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:1769","story":"anomaly-star-lifting-category"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.1020.c","label":{"zh":"将微波束改造成武器。","en":"Weaponize the beams."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:STAR_LIFTING_WEAPONS","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:1794","story":"anomaly-star-lifting-category"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"owner","value":false,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}}]]},{"key":"distar.1020.b","label":{"zh":"离开。","en":"Leave."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"story.5","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:1756","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt","line":1743},"sets":["star_lifting"],"names":{"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"special_projects:STAR_LIFTING","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"废弃外星平台","en":"Abandoned Star Platform"},"texts":[{"zh":"一座废弃的外星平台漂浮在[star_lifting_star.GetName]的轨道上。如果我们能设法修复它，可是我们改善并利用恒星提供的能源。","en":"A decrepit platform of ancient alien design orbits [star_lifting_star.GetName]. If we could find a way to repair it, it would allow us to improve and harness the star's energy outflow."}],"sections":[{"zh":"轨道上有$COUNT$/$REQUIRED$[GetConstructorShipAndArkshipPluralType]。","en":"Has $COUNT$/$REQUIRED$ [GetConstructorShipAndArkshipPluralType] in orbit."}],"image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.1021","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1037","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-star-lifting-category"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":1015},"names":{"star_lifting_star.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"distar.1021","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"与火共舞","en":"Playing with Fire"},"texts":[{"zh":"在大量修复工作之后，平台已经上线，而恒星现在正向宇宙中喷发大量的能源。但这一路上并非一帆风顺。\n\n当大型微波束初次启动时，工程师们几乎引发了一场连锁反应，后果可能导致一场巨大的恒星爆发，将平台以及星系中所有的星球全都摧毁。原来远古外星蓝图与使用说明中存在着大量计算错误，程度严重到可使平台无法运作。\n\n幸好我们及时发现了错误，并调整了微波束的强度，而太阳风的流出也稳定了下来。","en":"After extensive repairs the platform has been brought online and the star is now hurling massive amounts of energy into the cosmos. But the journey there has not been without its hurdles.\n\nWhen the giant microwave beams were first activated, the engineers nearly set off a chain reaction that could have ended in a solar eruption so massive it would have blasted the platform and all system planets out of existence. As it turns out, the ancient alien blueprints and manuals were riddled with miscalculations so severe that the platform would have been inoperable.\n\nLuckily the mistakes were caught in time, the strength of the beams has since been calibrated, and the solar wind outflow has been stabilized."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.1021.a","label":{"zh":"一颗只属于我们的太阳能电池！","en":"A solar battery, just for us!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.1021.b","label":{"zh":"哎，软体动物……身子软，脑子也软……","en":"Ah, Mollusks. Mushy bodies, mushy minds..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_species_class","arg":"MOL","scope":"","value":false}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt","line":1807}},{"id":"special_projects:STAR_LIFTING_WEAPONS","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"废弃外星平台","en":"Abandoned Star Platform"},"texts":[{"zh":"一座废弃的外星平台漂浮在[star_lifting_star.GetName]的轨道上。它有一些非常实验性的微波束科技，有改造成武器的潜力。","en":"A decrepit platform of ancient alien design orbits [star_lifting_star.GetName]. It has some highly experimental microwave beam technology with potential for weaponization."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c6521a2bac2bb7c2248c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.1022","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1062","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-star-lifting-category"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":1045},"names":{"star_lifting_star.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"distar.1022","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"软体动物微波束","en":"Molluscoid Microwave Beams"},"texts":[{"zh":"[star_lifting_ship.GetName]的船员们并没有花太多时间就得出结论：这个恒星平台的设计，用科学专员[star_lifting_leader.GetName]的话来说，是疯子的杰作。微波束非常粗劣，未经校准，而且在正常运转之前还需要大量的打磨。不过，它们很快就被证明是上好的武器。","en":"It did not take the crew of the [star_lifting_ship.GetName] long to conclude that the design of the star platform was, in Science Officer [star_lifting_leader.GetName]'s own words, the work of madmen. The microwave beams were crude, miscalibrated, and would have needed much refinement before they would work as intended. However, they soon proved to make excellent weapons."},{"zh":"我们将软体动物微波束改造成武器的尝试……壮观地失败了。在启动时，我们才发现微波束的设计烂到简直无法用语言形容，最终这一科学的失败化作一团壮观的蘑菇云，而我们的科研团队则在千钧一发之际逃了出来。","en":"Our attempt to weaponize the Molluscoid microwave beams has failed... spectacularly. On activation, it turned out that the design of the beams was faulty beyond comprehension and the science crew only narrowly escaped the platform as it exploded in a magnificent mushroom-shaped display of scientific failure."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c6521a2bac2bb7c2248c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.1022.a","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}}]]},{"key":"distar.1022.b","label":{"zh":"太惨了。","en":"Disastrous."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}}]]},{"key":"distar.1022.c","label":{"zh":"这些软体动物根本就不该捣鼓科学……","en":"Those Molluscoids had no business doing science..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_species_class","arg":"MOL","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt","line":1856},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}}]]}],"names":{"star_lifting_leader.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"},"st